gm\",\"compensation\":null,\"descriptorId\":\"stmt_ui_2\",\"effectId\":\"effect.5207623a9600f24155aff2b9fcf7a99e58167bcfa9ef2eb94c01f553585e2120\",\"executionId\":\"player.f87d19179fdf8536f9fc579c\",\"kind\":\"audio.play\",\"logicalSequence\":1,\"originatingRevision\":2,\"payload\":{\"action\":\"play\",\"asset\":\"night_travel_theme\",\"bus\":\"bgm\",\"loop\":true,\"volumePermille\":300},\"policy\":\"pure\",\"replayKey\":\"replay.stmt_ui_2\"}],\"entryId\":\"entry.5bf75e8bc3912ee8488e528e3a612da974953e1e8a0bd3efd5f662fa5da8e65b\",\"event\":{\"command\":\"audio\",\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_2\",\"kind\":\"direction\",\"parameters\":{\"action\":\"play\",\"asset\":\"night_travel_theme\",\"bus\":\"bgm\",\"loop\":true,\"volumePermille\":300}},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":1,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.d04fcea3f8a29a9f37838012cf22f63655ed5c43ebd9c93e11f5e8196f50c4ae\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.74c1c8c44c96cdc0cf8926005ce9af0cbfaf2eb7a3c2e21764fc1c75bc1c6d3f\",\"effects\":[{\"awaitMode\":\"detached\",\"cancellationScope\":\"scope.scene_87825610ea97b89eeea8\",\"channel\":\"audio.ambient\",\"compensation\":null,\"descriptorId\":\"stmt_ui_3\",\"effectId\":\"effect.b2f9da2278f627877acd09ad2fb52126b21be2045d3bccbe0de9fb418b4f8399\",\"executionId\":\"player.f87d19179fdf8536f9fc579c\",\"kind\":\"audio.play\",\"logicalSequence\":2,\"originatingRevision\":3,\"payload\":{\"action\":\"play\",\"asset\":\"soft_rain\",\"bus\":\"ambient\",\"loop\":true,\"volumePermille\":200},\"policy\":\"pure\",\"replayKey\":\"replay.stmt_ui_3\"}],\"entryId\":\"entry.aee39615ad2a3d18c2516146fc9c2438b6ce85471ab30aeb18eb81224f68521e\",\"event\":{\"command\":\"audio\",\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_3\",\"kind\":\"direction\",\"parameters\":{\"action\":\"play\",\"asset\":\"soft_rain\",\"bus\":\"ambient\",\"loop\":true,\"volumePermille\":200}},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":2,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.0d1ec28e099f09be5bedfe49f77296d701d691606a5764c69781d00b7c4d3c93\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.d04fcea3f8a29a9f37838012cf22f63655ed5c43ebd9c93e11f5e8196f50c4ae\",\"effects\":[{\"awaitMode\":\"detached\",\"cancellationScope\":\"scope.scene_87825610ea97b89eeea8\",\"channel\":\"show.primary\",\"compensation\":null,\"descriptorId\":\"stmt_ui_4\",\"effectId\":\"effect.6d27e14d9871ce89fc8c5dec0490dfc329f8b623e733b030ca1f19e94b5bd541\",\"executionId\":\"player.f87d19179fdf8536f9fc579c\",\"kind\":\"show.show\",\"logicalSequence\":3,\"originatingRevision\":4,\"payload\":{\"action\":\"show\",\"asset\":\"xia_letter\",\"position\":\"left\",\"slot\":\"primary\",\"z\":0},\"policy\":\"pure\",\"replayKey\":\"replay.stmt_ui_4\"}],\"entryId\":\"entry.9b20d2e9f6a6534dd466877d332e1e95d9502f92ac180cd2fe2ec31ac77c69e2\",\"event\":{\"command\":\"show\",\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_4\",\"kind\":\"direction\",\"parameters\":{\"action\":\"show\",\"asset\":\"xia_letter\",\"position\":\"left\",\"slot\":\"primary\",\"z\":\"0\"}},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":3,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.01a142fbef457925865033f3f28c0f52eb741530cae8d745154bdbfb8bd7944c\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.0d1ec28e099f09be5bedfe49f77296d701d691606a5764c69781d00b7c4d3c93\",\"effects\":[],\"entryId\":\"entry.60358dd29564ad51b9d244c2d59d5b9bdd1847cb108e27202435c239d0ee1fe0\",\"event\":{\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_5\",\"kind\":\"narration\",\"text\":\"售票员把窗口里的灯关掉时，雨正沿着站台的屋檐连成一条线。站台上的钟比手机慢了三分钟。林远核对了两次，没有走去询问值班员。他看见玻璃上自己的倒影，才发现他已经穿着这件外套站了很久。行李箱旁挂着新公司的地址，手机里存着一份还没签字的合同；这些东西都能说明他要去哪里，却没有一样能替他解释为什么迟迟不肯往前走。\",\"textId\":\"txt_ui_6\"},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":4,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.2fe55775a749f07bf73f7b90a24a0ae0d3718ea0d0a75ae00ab54b9ad8ad1f62\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.01a142fbef457925865033f3f28c0f52eb741530cae8d745154bdbfb8bd7944c\",\"effects\":[],\"entryId\":\"entry.df0158056a0336d02c75ab0f57121a5f74c2ff1009011e93184675ddd21c949d\",\"event\":{\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_7\",\"kind\":\"narration\",\"text\":\"小夏不是来阻止他出发的。她在短信里只说，要把借了半年那本书还给他，顺便把书里的照片也还给他。林远原以为这是一件很容易的事：收下书，认真道谢，等广播响起后挥手。可当她撑着伞从街对面走来，他忽然不记得自己排练过的第一句话是什么了。\",\"textId\":\"txt_ui_8\"},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":5,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.5886463dc3ded75fd17deaa7729bd09dce20d10e09e6823a52c566d0c10b1f05\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.2fe55775a749f07bf73f7b90a24a0ae0d3718ea0d0a75ae00ab54b9ad8ad1f62\",\"effects\":[],\"entryId\":\"entry.829a36ca872020cd29983783107edc72fd39c563c2331794200e50855aaae7fe\",\"event\":{\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_9\",\"kind\":\"narration\",\"text\":\"照片上是一片没有拍到人的海。去年他们各自请了半天假，到了车站才知道列车停运，只能在便利店买两杯热饮，坐着听了一下午雨。那张照片后来由小夏寄来，背面写着：没到的地方不必作废。林远把它夹进书里，每次搬家都带着，却一次也没有认真回复。\",\"textId\":\"txt_ui_10\"},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":6,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.7879b16062bfe3288236b17ee9a203309c5295ece6417b547d9ad616efad1040\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.5886463dc3ded75fd17deaa7729bd09dce20d10e09e6823a52c566d0c10b1f05\",\"effects\":[],\"entryId\":\"entry.eb6e58f987d1ef34fe354b6a227af002884b90634d6fb27b0b2c03892c7e33cb\",\"event\":{\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_11\",\"kind\":\"narration\",\"text\":\"他想过许多合理的理由。项目赶进度，新工作的面试，还有一张要交房租的账单。生活确实忙，也确实不容易，可那些理由越整齐，他越清楚自己遗漏了什么：他在所有能回答的事情上回答得很快，只有在小夏问他想不想再约一次的时候，总是说等忙完这一阵。\",\"textId\":\"txt_ui_12\"},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":7,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.dc333faddfa5d05ea3ad35f531dabda93fba980cca6f2e2aa67bc04641b2b3ea\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.7879b16062bfe3288236b17ee9a203309c5295ece6417b547d9ad616efad1040\",\"effects\":[],\"entryId\":\"entry.0fb2942aa88e271652a89ac8a3a590ad5bf0be890129b91cf02dffb6011e783b\",\"event\":{\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_13\",\"kind\":\"narration\",\"text\":\"站台的雨味让他想起那间租了三年的房间。窗边原本留着摆画架的位置，后来堆满了纸箱。他给这次换工作起名叫重新开始，仿佛只要把地址换掉，箱子里那些没画完的东西就会自己展开。小夏知道那些画，却从没催他交一张能被称作作品的结果。\",\"textId\":\"txt_ui_14\"},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":8,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.7b2651b15dc0a96e4c59b605c85d6721f3411ed775fb29e703ed7348fef9aa37\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.dc333faddfa5d05ea3ad35f531dabda93fba980cca6f2e2aa67bc04641b2b3ea\",\"effects\":[{\"awaitMode\":\"detached\",\"cancellationScope\":\"scope.scene_87825610ea97b89eeea8\",\"channel\":\"show.primary\",\"compensation\":null,\"descriptorId\":\"stmt_ui_6\",\"effectId\":\"effect.c9ae2a43d49343c2899528ea89f044a700de3b0cbed1b654ebf4f44a83cf81d6\",\"executionId\":\"player.f87d19179fdf8536f9fc579c\",\"kind\":\"show.show\",\"logicalSequence\":4,\"originatingRevision\":10,\"payload\":{\"action\":\"show\",\"asset\":\"xia_thoughtful\",\"position\":\"left\",\"slot\":\"primary\",\"z\":0},\"policy\":\"pure\",\"replayKey\":\"replay.stmt_ui_6\"}],\"entryId\":\"entry.90ceac2ec33a457fe59f3f9bab77af32eac49fe76e75c96ad7dac169521d9915\",\"event\":{\"command\":\"show\",\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_6\",\"kind\":\"direction\",\"parameters\":{\"action\":\"show\",\"asset\":\"xia_thoughtful\",\"position\":\"left\",\"slot\":\"primary\",\"z\":\"0\"}},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":9,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.584a92818f86f6ecd4aab02893eee537d87bc90814289cc43e33fee13a2bfd94\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.7b2651b15dc0a96e4c59b605c85d6721f3411ed775fb29e703ed7348fef9aa37\",\"effects\":[],\"entryId\":\"entry.8b84c49c72cf58485f8d08f072adcd84a3c1f194f6681fe51137405f8cb1d909\",\"event\":{\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_15\",\"kind\":\"narration\",\"text\":\"“我带了另一件东西。”小夏从包里取出一个没有封口的信封，“本来约好明年再拆，可现在先给你也可以。”她没有把信塞到他手里，只放在他们中间的长椅上。信封被雨气浸得有一点软，林远盯着那个角，突然觉得自己不能再用赶车来结束今天的谈话。\",\"textId\":\"txt_ui_16\"},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":10,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.6039aadefefca475f7e89266e2f477ab954625d5a443bfa74594be93df9c8553\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.584a92818f86f6ecd4aab02893eee537d87bc90814289cc43e33fee13a2bfd94\",\"effects\":[],\"entryId\":\"entry.b766eb3e66eebcef00a7ca2cb96f9dfbafe049cdba9ba5dab5adab67608b0bb0\",\"event\":{\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_17\",\"kind\":\"narration\",\"text\":\"列车晚点的通知替他们争来二十分钟。周围几个人抱怨了一声，又低头看手机；小夏却把伞靠在椅边，像是刚刚得到一张新的座位票。她问候车室是不是还开着。林远看向那扇亮着暖灯的门，点了点头，第一次主动把行李箱拉离检票线。\",\"textId\":\"txt_ui_18\"},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":11,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.d5889d76225b2fec6d789a87bb742a27ed0fb396da8bb15379cb3f061af3b6b6\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.6039aadefefca475f7e89266e2f477ab954625d5a443bfa74594be93df9c8553\",\"effects\":[],\"entryId\":\"entry.451af4ed224b3b76f32ef3dc7bdcb877726c4441f1f3a04a68a37c2f466bf28f\",\"event\":{\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_19\",\"kind\":\"narration\",\"text\":\"他们把湿外套抖了抖，没有立即谈信，也没有先给彼此一个结论。林远替她搬开椅上的报纸，小夏给他的书套上一个干燥的纸袋。原来愿意多停一会儿可以是这样小的一件事：承认话还没说完，并且真的坐下来，为它腾出时间。\",\"textId\":\"txt_ui_20\"},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":12,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.b883d18546196079d0da35cb30fb54d5a073a0b105096e281861cb8dc120fc5c\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.d5889d76225b2fec6d789a87bb742a27ed0fb396da8bb15379cb3f061af3b6b6\",\"effects\":[],\"entryId\":\"entry.cde77b32c4c8461eab8fb2fb6ff5defd5e753df128eacde5a641631ee3e9a56c\",\"event\":{\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_21\",\"kind\":\"narration\",\"text\":\"走向候车室之前，林远给新公司的联系人写了一条消息，说列车晚点，预计到达时间会有变化。发送成功后，他收起手机，从长椅上捡起那封信。纸角已经有些湿了，他用掌心护着，抬头等小夏。\",\"textId\":\"txt_ui_22\"},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":13,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.83d23b45ae01091df22287e035e81e13138617b59fcd4c5ac1b5e431359f9438\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.b883d18546196079d0da35cb30fb54d5a073a0b105096e281861cb8dc120fc5c\",\"effects\":[{\"awaitMode\":\"detached\",\"cancellationScope\":\"scope.scene_87825610ea97b89eeea8\",\"channel\":\"audio.voice\",\"compensation\":null,\"descriptorId\":\"stmt_ui_8\",\"effectId\":\"effect.6a32107078fbceec7e0f5f7da1263a19df2ccb45380fc3c641a16167d6a2ac02\",\"executionId\":\"player.f87d19179fdf8536f9fc579c\",\"kind\":\"audio.play\",\"logicalSequence\":5,\"originatingRevision\":15,\"payload\":{\"action\":\"play\",\"asset\":\"voice_01\",\"bus\":\"voice\",\"loop\":false,\"volumePermille\":1000},\"policy\":\"pure\",\"replayKey\":\"replay.stmt_ui_8\"}],\"entryId\":\"entry.ab6592a3dc17daae9d3ef5e922f8249e2fef9f5997b30112c9f2d9fb721a28b3\",\"event\":{\"command\":\"audio\",\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_8\",\"kind\":\"direction\",\"parameters\":{\"action\":\"play\",\"asset\":\"voice_01\",\"bus\":\"voice\",\"loop\":false,\"volumePermille\":1000}},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":14,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.e5df008eb06fa5ca81ea74434c005cc235b708063cc89dfd2d95aa2018b7564b\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.83d23b45ae01091df22287e035e81e13138617b59fcd4c5ac1b5e431359f9438\",\"effects\":[],\"entryId\":\"entry.4edf7ffaa3e9135fdc320118de297c327cc49ad6b078e6b8470aaa0291cd3cde\",\"event\":{\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_25\",\"kind\":\"dialogue\",\"speakerId\":\"character_e3a0cb3de37d44b4\",\"text\":\"进去读吧。我想先把今天的话说完。\",\"textId\":\"txt_ui_26\"},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":15,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.1226a8a928cf95ee8d4e6a6f186c5c5eda0b18d066ec72769e6c45293e41ea84\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.e5df008eb06fa5ca81ea74434c005cc235b708063cc89dfd2d95aa2018b7564b\",\"effects\":[{\"awaitMode\":\"detached\",\"cancellationScope\":\"scope.scene_87825610ea97b89eeea8\",\"channel\":\"audio.voice\",\"compensation\":null,\"descriptorId\":\"stmt_ui_10\",\"effectId\":\"effect.1d7f74db75e7bd17f38f67ba6e843c4f5949d6f111a78a8915fbbda2d949aef2\",\"executionId\":\"player.f87d19179fdf8536f9fc579c\",\"kind\":\"audio.stop\",\"logicalSequence\":6,\"originatingRevision\":17,\"payload\":{\"action\":\"stop\",\"bus\":\"voice\"},\"policy\":\"pure\",\"replayKey\":\"replay.stmt_ui_10\"}],\"entryId\":\"entry.b585c4228691e36def601eda883f0a04c9087ae354cc4db35ceaa63bfdc2b837\",\"event\":{\"command\":\"audio\",\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_10\",\"kind\":\"direction\",\"parameters\":{\"action\":\"stop\",\"bus\":\"voice\"}},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":16,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.5aff566127bfcb4d6157afd654aec33d7fb98f58baebf1fbfd8378e081bf7d49\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.1226a8a928cf95ee8d4e6a6f186c5c5eda0b18d066ec72769e6c45293e41ea84\",\"effects\":[],\"entryId\":\"entry.dc018de143f5cd6711bbc7d2332444642aa56ec9862459a3a43716f68a1825fc\",\"event\":{\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_23\",\"kind\":\"narration\",\"text\":\"广播再一次提醒乘客留意车次。小夏应了一声，走在他前面推开候车室的门。林远拉着箱子跟进去。雨声被挡在玻璃外，仍然清晰；她把伞收进门边的桶里，替他留住快要合上的门。\",\"textId\":\"txt_ui_24\"},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":17,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.d40db4d5035e155e8dfae7ecf9957b69d66e5f6718ed1378a951100561c8317a\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.5aff566127bfcb4d6157afd654aec33d7fb98f58baebf1fbfd8378e081bf7d49\",\"effects\":[{\"awaitMode\":\"detached\",\"cancellationScope\":\"scope.scene_fff36353633c42d1\",\"channel\":\"background\",\"compensation\":null,\"descriptorId\":\"stmt_ui_29\",\"effectId\":\"effect.0ee59e6900bb2c0d267f3e357ca4be68abd99983883dc0d9008b2b5f97b71a75\",\"executionId\":\"player.f87d19179fdf8536f9fc579c\",\"kind\":\"background.set\",\"logicalSequence\":7,\"originatingRevision\":20,\"payload\":{\"action\":\"set\",\"asset\":\"waiting_room\",\"duration\":\"300ms\",\"transition\":\"fade\"},\"policy\":\"pure\",\"replayKey\":\"replay.stmt_ui_29\"}],\"entryId\":\"entry.6f1e73465f7abe56e1450e69d4a40159f4aabc2d4f3f82be5d948afc72279f52\",\"event\":{\"command\":\"background\",\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_29\",\"kind\":\"direction\",\"parameters\":{\"action\":\"set\",\"asset\":\"waiting_room\",\"duration\":\"300ms\",\"transition\":\"fade\"}},\"executedInstructions\":2,\"historyIndex\":18,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.990c69b54a74c70a7bb0e5f88b47ae4fd3f9d6eed2be5bd9dfe7c4041eb63481\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.d40db4d5035e155e8dfae7ecf9957b69d66e5f6718ed1378a951100561c8317a\",\"effects\":[{\"awaitMode\":\"detached\",\"cancellationScope\":\"scope.scene_fff36353633c42d1\",\"channel\":\"show.primary\",\"compensation\":null,\"descriptorId\":\"stmt_ui_30\",\"effectId\":\"effect.787632df3e9cb0ff1ec4f2030fbb9cbb9eb04817f5d8cbc8396a4cf8ecdd28d3\",\"executionId\":\"player.f87d19179fdf8536f9fc579c\",\"kind\":\"show.show\",\"logicalSequence\":8,\"originatingRevision\":21,\"payload\":{\"action\":\"show\",\"asset\":\"xia_thoughtful\",\"position\":\"left\",\"slot\":\"primary\",\"z\":0},\"policy\":\"pure\",\"replayKey\":\"replay.stmt_ui_30\"}],\"entryId\":\"entry.7a30659dcc7560f0a4b6e3914dec02b8838e495abc5367be4b429670e819263a\",\"event\":{\"command\":\"show\",\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_30\",\"kind\":\"direction\",\"parameters\":{\"action\":\"show\",\"asset\":\"xia_thoughtful\",\"position\":\"left\",\"slot\":\"primary\",\"z\":\"0\"}},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":19,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.34e27adc553561c1da7cc6d9081b1dbcb333c24f523935b3e2c57d3709221cc9\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.990c69b54a74c70a7bb0e5f88b47ae4fd3f9d6eed2be5bd9dfe7c4041eb63481\",\"effects\":[],\"entryId\":\"entry.2398768b5c9d077a5349b25a9c4792a53a088f7d0d0b3b83dd4b60c3817e093c\",\"event\":{\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_31\",\"kind\":\"narration\",\"text\":\"候车室里只剩一排灯还亮着。小夏选了靠窗的两张椅子，隔着玻璃能看见站台上的信号灯。林远把箱子放在脚边，拆信前先问她是否介意读出声。她摇头，说如果有哪句让他不知道怎么接，也可以先停下来。信不是考试，不要求谁立刻给出正确答案。\",\"textId\":\"txt_ui_32\"},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":20,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.d8bb33ddd000f97c7a7e612b7762dfcefbcf5ec14495cf2d5f1874b9e4094c05\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.34e27adc553561c1da7cc6d9081b1dbcb333c24f523935b3e2c57d3709221cc9\",\"effects\":[],\"entryId\":\"entry.33a279ab6e1674c5edcc6ed9fc98ef6e297e295432b92bd722a844b8c766c3e8\",\"event\":{\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_33\",\"kind\":\"narration\",\"text\":\"第一张纸写着他们错过海边列车那天的事。小夏记得林远把最后一杯热饮给了她，自己喝的那杯已经凉了。林远不记得自己做过这个选择，只记得那天一直没有想出该聊什么。他读到这里，才意识到有些在他看来失败的下午，在别人心里并没有那么糟。\",\"textId\":\"txt_ui_34\"},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":21,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.72f34fc0c77de16812055a46e297ea40bd67123f6b3f4ac38c012149b9576364\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.d8bb33ddd000f97c7a7e612b7762dfcefbcf5ec14495cf2d5f1874b9e4094c05\",\"effects\":[],\"entryId\":\"entry.a7e30bbc639f8ff128bb42a248f99c74528c72e4c94eedb1a3b7ec8f12ead623\",\"event\":{\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_35\",\"kind\":\"narration\",\"text\":\"第二张纸写得慢，字也比第一张小。她说自己换了一份工作，学着在下班后关掉群消息，不再把所有人的请求都算成必须马上完成的事。她也会害怕停下来，怕别人认为自己不够努力。但那天在车站，他说一班车的错过不等于一整天被浪费，她后来常想起这句话。\",\"textId\":\"txt_ui_36\"},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":22,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.57af1da773b49156560375387b7f4473baceaff7787e45054338a92c2230846e\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.72f34fc0c77de16812055a46e297ea40bd67123f6b3f4ac38c012149b9576364\",\"effects\":[],\"entryId\":\"entry.7ef0e602c13ccca9424598e71635cda57fcb9ac035261da8309364cb11d8a6e4\",\"event\":{\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_37\",\"kind\":\"narration\",\"text\":\"林远把信放在膝盖上。他想说自己现在已经很少记得这么宽松地对待生活，想说那句话或许只是当时为了安慰她随口讲的。可小夏没有让他证明每句话都能坚持一辈子。她只问，今晚他还愿不愿意试着把那句话留给自己，不必先保证从此不再犹豫。\",\"textId\":\"txt_ui_38\"},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":23,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.5360797dcd7be76806d6429ea19185786980df189153bfe0aac272526d5c6004\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.57af1da773b49156560375387b7f4473baceaff7787e45054338a92c2230846e\",\"effects\":[],\"entryId\":\"entry.e70465d269eda2112ce49fd59da5eed147ee7292febcd137102eaaddeb6a6d0f\",\"event\":{\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_39\",\"kind\":\"narration\",\"text\":\"他告诉她新工作的合同并不是最后期限。对方愿意让他先做两周的试合作，也看过他画的草稿。这部分内容从来没出现在他讲给朋友的计划里；他总把计划讲成必须成功的一条直线，仿佛留下任何转弯，就会显得决心不够。说出来以后，那条线终于变得像一条真实的路。\",\"textId\":\"txt_ui_40\"},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":24,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.8bc736b00ae6d48b68193d5a3c68c223fb525d400e9e8910627d5dcd1d0ac4b6\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.5360797dcd7be76806d6429ea19185786980df189153bfe0aac272526d5c6004\",\"effects\":[],\"entryId\":\"entry.b1a1c43a5b7049ba2641488704b97d8b8b9a744203bb92a22bc8434d606f1c16\",\"event\":{\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_41\",\"kind\":\"narration\",\"text\":\"小夏也有没说过的事。她申请了一个周末的课程，想学怎样修复旧书。第一堂课就在这个周末，她担心自己做不出什么像样的东西，又不愿意因为担心一直不报名。林远看着手里的信纸，第一次发现她并不是站在岸边等他回来的人，她也正在决定自己的出发。\",\"textId\":\"txt_ui_42\"},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":25,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.932cb5d560db9acbec50e8a95c947f8b634eb4cfccdf56895fbb0ee6750314ba\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.8bc736b00ae6d48b68193d5a3c68c223fb525d400e9e8910627d5dcd1d0ac4b6\",\"effects\":[{\"awaitMode\":\"detached\",\"cancellationScope\":\"scope.scene_fff36353633c42d1\",\"channel\":\"show.primary\",\"compensation\":null,\"descriptorId\":\"stmt_ui_12\",\"effectId\":\"effect.9c4016f093077214612e6148185591aecb342a8bc185c8ecc6a3e56ba03e934b\",\"executionId\":\"player.f87d19179fdf8536f9fc579c\",\"kind\":\"show.show\",\"logicalSequence\":9,\"originatingRevision\":28,\"payload\":{\"action\":\"show\",\"asset\":\"xia_letter\",\"position\":\"left\",\"slot\":\"primary\",\"z\":0},\"policy\":\"pure\",\"replayKey\":\"replay.stmt_ui_12\"}],\"entryId\":\"entry.6fed80f0542f2224e0aa763cb39768f2afb02644024589c4a2fb382df99021d7\",\"event\":{\"command\":\"show\",\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_12\",\"kind\":\"direction\",\"parameters\":{\"action\":\"show\",\"asset\":\"xia_letter\",\"position\":\"left\",\"slot\":\"primary\",\"z\":\"0\"}},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":26,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.b7d3597d891abba7ca7b987d763779e3a1e7c125c831c08b166a15131698a88a\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.932cb5d560db9acbec50e8a95c947f8b634eb4cfccdf56895fbb0ee6750314ba\",\"effects\":[],\"entryId\":\"entry.9494a110b1e86ffec2ce05e2dbd9002cd242c8200db68818bffb3da36c319ec5\",\"event\":{\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_43\",\"kind\":\"narration\",\"text\":\"“所以你不需要为了我留下。”小夏说，“但也不用为了显得勇敢，什么都来不及安排就走。”她把旧照片翻到背面，指着那句没到的地方不必作废。那不是要他替去年补上一场旅行，而是提醒他们：一件事情可以继续，前提是两个人都愿意为它写下下一步。\",\"textId\":\"txt_ui_44\"},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":27,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.fa94bd44fca4a61a9f8a04f965b03f1259b3de3beda5ffce1978daaeea0c0e20\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.b7d3597d891abba7ca7b987d763779e3a1e7c125c831c08b166a15131698a88a\",\"effects\":[],\"entryId\":\"entry.3aabb70f93c9be9c4e43a67d6cc45530c2bdb852e4a69dbeb9d5743af1aa9d34\",\"event\":{\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_45\",\"kind\":\"narration\",\"text\":\"林远从包里找到一支快没墨的笔，在纸袋上写了两个日期。一个是试合作结束的那天，另一个是试合作结束后的第一个周末。他们并排看着，发现第二个日期两个人都可以空出来。小夏把笔推回他手边，等他把约定记进日历。\",\"textId\":\"txt_ui_46\"},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":28,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.1c780aeb06397bd48704af7811ee1c2e63452ce49c7baf7bef2c34104fbcabb5\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.fa94bd44fca4a61a9f8a04f965b03f1259b3de3beda5ffce1978daaeea0c0e20\",\"effects\":[{\"awaitMode\":\"detached\",\"cancellationScope\":\"scope.scene_fff36353633c42d1\",\"channel\":\"audio.voice\",\"compensation\":null,\"descriptorId\":\"stmt_ui_14\",\"effectId\":\"effect.241ccd17d897353a72d99fe635a91198c7fd4aa60759526e41e286dae5534834\",\"executionId\":\"player.f87d19179fdf8536f9fc579c\",\"kind\":\"audio.play\",\"logicalSequence\":10,\"originatingRevision\":31,\"payload\":{\"action\":\"play\",\"asset\":\"voice_02\",\"bus\":\"voice\",\"loop\":false,\"volumePermille\":1000},\"policy\":\"pure\",\"replayKey\":\"replay.stmt_ui_14\"}],\"entryId\":\"entry.48940f93e1545c3e868742161d9656a2021e2a619c6f7c2cad92fde5b3c6f3c6\",\"event\":{\"command\":\"audio\",\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_14\",\"kind\":\"direction\",\"parameters\":{\"action\":\"play\",\"asset\":\"voice_02\",\"bus\":\"voice\",\"loop\":false,\"volumePermille\":1000}},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":29,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.963f0a81e80c85abdec7b37540389dc5cceb7746924ab4c073a7b394bb2ab613\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.1c780aeb06397bd48704af7811ee1c2e63452ce49c7baf7bef2c34104fbcabb5\",\"effects\":[],\"entryId\":\"entry.613cafaa82b57a4c362ba7ec96349b967453e1cc11501abb6eab255534eea753\",\"event\":{\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_51\",\"kind\":\"dialogue\",\"speakerId\":\"character_2357b9a159834f77\",\"text\":\"把那个日期圈起来，变化了我们提前说。\",\"textId\":\"txt_ui_52\"},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":30,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.519820b1dfcd615ee24a0a27a3f5f50e1b4c52cec9e02de0082b1bee4a50ea5a\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.963f0a81e80c85abdec7b37540389dc5cceb7746924ab4c073a7b394bb2ab613\",\"effects\":[{\"awaitMode\":\"detached\",\"cancellationScope\":\"scope.scene_fff36353633c42d1\",\"channel\":\"audio.voice\",\"compensation\":null,\"descriptorId\":\"stmt_ui_16\",\"effectId\":\"effect.4e74bc08eca13b25a31e5249a06d1783072bebeed2d6de48061676afc38c45c8\",\"executionId\":\"player.f87d19179fdf8536f9fc579c\",\"kind\":\"audio.stop\",\"logicalSequence\":11,\"originatingRevision\":33,\"payload\":{\"action\":\"stop\",\"bus\":\"voice\"},\"policy\":\"pure\",\"replayKey\":\"replay.stmt_ui_16\"}],\"entryId\":\"entry.7d4cf2c7e9d26170aa946a784c84339228a577f9ea0561600f0bf7f530fd0f82\",\"event\":{\"command\":\"audio\",\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_16\",\"kind\":\"direction\",\"parameters\":{\"action\":\"stop\",\"bus\":\"voice\"}},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":31,\"input\":null},{\"afterCheckpointId\":\"history.1a153ab187edd63cce4bdd4a11e04ace4853e4559abfead00dd867e61ac2afb2\",\"barriers\":[],\"beforeCheckpointId\":\"history.519820b1dfcd615ee24a0a27a3f5f50e1b4c52cec9e02de0082b1bee4a50ea5a\",\"effects\":[],\"entryId\":\"entry.dedf05284c721e0e2a61521c2b7086d1aac26f7001914039f3f0090002c5f816\",\"event\":{\"instructionId\":\"stmt_ui_47\",\"kind\":\"narration\",\"text\":\"候车室的门开了，一对提着购物袋的老人进来避雨。林远给他们让出靠近暖气的位置，把自己的椅子挪到小夏旁边。信还剩最后一页，小夏说那页可以在路上读，也可以留到别的地方。林远重新把纸放进信封，觉得这一次不是拖延，而是知道故事还有可以抵达的地方。\",\"textId\":\"txt_ui_48\"},\"executedInstructions\":1,\"historyIndex\":32,\"input\":null}],\"executionId\":\"player.f87d19179fdf8536f9fc579c\",\"inputTombstones\":[],\"irVersion\":\"1.2.0\",\"projectId\":\"project_a983033c0f7180355c93\",\"runtimeVersion\":\"0.6.0\",\"schemaVersion\":2},\"historyHash\":\"6eb47f1d2ad5685c9fdc89f051e096c2376ed285520e465b7056e6960f0a5b82\",\"irVersion\":\"1.2.0\",\"projectId\":\"project_a983033c0f7180355c93\",\"runtimeVersion\":\"0.6.0\",\"schemaVersion\":2}","checkpointStepId":null,"schemaVersion":3,"format":"world.player-save-slot","migratedFromSchemaVersion":null},"previewBase64":null,"origin":"current"},"sha256":"e9b23321158f87573e05c3b698a00e5d4cc05bb0aa79be52d9fc05a647f45582"}